[quests]
swhkeyskyreachtitle=The Watchfire
swhkeyskyreachdesc=The Warden can build a watchfire that the Skyreach's own summoning stones will answer to - if you bring him the storm to light it with.
swhkeyskyreachreward=Skyreach Watchfire + 6x Stormsteel Bar
swhkeyedentitle=The Garden Stair
swhkeyedendesc=Eden guards its sap and its pollen with teeth and stings. Take both from the garden and the Warden will cut you a stair that its stones recognise.
swhkeyedenreward=Eden Garden Stair + 8x Stormsteel Bar
swhkeysteinfeldtitle=The Mourning Angel
swhkeysteinfelddesc=Steinfeld is nothing but pale stone and the echoes trapped in it. Bring back enough of each and the Warden will raise one of its angels in your own settlement.
swhkeysteinfeldreward=Steinfeld Mourning Angel + 10x Stormsteel Bar
swhkeyghostrealmtitle=The Raven Perch
swhkeyghostrealmdesc=Nothing comes out of the Aftergarden that the fog has not already touched. Carry back its bonewood and its spectral ore, and the Warden will set a raven over your gate.
swhkeyghostrealmreward=Aftergarden Raven Perch + 10x Spiritsteel Bar
swhkeycrookedbeyondtitle=A Door of Your Own
swhkeycrookedbeyonddesc=Every door in the Crooked Beyond leads somewhere it should not. Bring the Warden its wood and its shards and he will hang you one that does it on purpose.
swhkeycrookedbeyondreward=Knott's Crooked Door + 12x Spiritsteel Bar
[misc]
regionkeyneedsettlement=A key piece only holds where people live. Stand it up inside your settlement.
regionkeyunlocked=The <key> settles into the ground,\nand somewhere far out a cold stone warms.
wardenkeyaskskyreach=There is a way to call the things that sleep out there - but they only answer their own kind. Bring me the storm and I will build you a watchfire.
wardenkeydoneskyreach=That will burn. Set it down at home, where the walls are yours.
wardenkeyaskeden=Eden next, then. Sap and pollen, and neither will be handed to you.
wardenkeydoneeden=Green things, and still warm. Take the stair - it knows the way its own stones are cut.
wardenkeyasksteinfeld=Steinfeld keeps its dead standing. Bring me pale stone and the echoes in it, and I will raise you one of its angels.
wardenkeydonesteinfeld=She is heavier than she looks. Give her ground she will be left alone on.
wardenkeyaskghostrealm=The Aftergarden, now, and you will want your chalk before you go. Bonewood and spectral ore.
wardenkeydoneghostrealm=A bird for the dead, and it will sit anywhere you put it. That is more than most of them will do.
wardenkeyaskcrookedbeyond=Last one, and the worst. The Crooked Beyond has a door for everything. Bring me the wood and the shards and I will hang you one that behaves.
wardenkeydonecrookedbeyond=There. A door of your own, and it opens on purpose. That is the whole set.
